  "description": "Casual street-style MTB hardtail or functional urban gravel bike – the Clunker EVO moves effortlessly between all categories and is always fun to ride. Its steering-linked front rack offers space for a Eurobox or beer crate, and thanks to its steering damper, the Clunker Evo always remains stable, even when loaded. Our developers have integrated the lighting components into the eye-catching design in a particularly unobtrusive way. With the particularly powerful Supernova Starstream Mini in the struts of the front luggage rack and the rear light in the seat post, safety and visibility are combined with maximum style. The quiet and visually striking Bafang rear wheel motor with integrated 520 watt-hour battery provides the necessary boost for riding and cruising in the city. Always casual, always practical, always fun to ride – with the Clunker EVO.",
